ert (die Registrierung des Sparse-Pakets wurde entfernt).\n- Ein Problem wurde behoben, bei dem Patch Management nach der Aktivierung über ein Unternehmen oder eine Benutzergruppe als „Unvollständige Aktivierung\" angezeigt wurde, obwohl es installiert war und funktionierte. Bereits betroffene Geräte zeigen nach dem Update den korrekten Status an.","tags":["fernsteuerung","fernzugriff","konferenzen","remote-control","remote-desktop","webkonferenz"]},"en-US":{"author":"TeamViewer Germany GmbH","copyright":"© 2005-2026 TeamViewer Germany GmbH","copyrightUrl":"https://www.teamviewer.com/en/legal/eula/","description":"Secure remote access and support.","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"Knowledge Base","DocumentUrl":"https://www.teamviewer.com/en/global/support/knowledge-base/"}],"license":"Proprietary","licenseUrl":"https://www.teamviewer.com/en/legal/eula/","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"TeamViewer is a comprehensive, remote access, remote control and remote support solution that works with almost every desktop and mobile platform, including Windows. It lets you remote in to computers or mobile devices located anywhere in the world and use them as though you were there.","moniker":"teamviewer","name":"TeamViewer","packageUrl":"https://www.teamviewer.com/en/download/windows/","privacyUrl":"https://www.teamviewer.com/en/legal/privacy-and-cookies/","publisher":"TeamViewer","publisherSupportUrl":"https://www.teamviewer.com/en/global/support/customer-support/","publisherUrl":"https://www.teamviewer.com/","purchaseUrl":"https://www.teamviewer.com/en/pricing/","releaseNotes":"New Features\n\nImprovements\n\nBugfixes\n- AI upscaling feature for AssistAR has been disabled (sparse package registration has been removed).\n- Fixed an issue where Patch Management showed \"Incomplete activation\" after it was activated through a company or user group, even though it was installed and working. Devices that are already affected show the correct status after the update.","tags":